    <briefdescription>
<para>Manages the replicated log for Raft consensus. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <ref refid="classthemisdb_1_1sharding_1_1_raft_log" kindref="compound">RaftLog</ref> maintains:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>An ordered sequence of log entries</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>The commit index (highest index known to be committed)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Thread-safe access to log operations</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Properties enforced:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Log Matching: If two logs contain an entry with the same index and term, then the logs are identical in all entries up through the given index</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Leader Completeness: If a log entry is committed in a given term, that entry will be present in the logs of the leaders for all higher-numbered terms </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
